# packages/

Scoped workspace packages `@involvex/ctrl-*`. Prefer `workspace:*` for internal deps.

## Package map

| Package | Focus |
|---------|--------|
| `ctrl-a` | Gateway daemon |
| `ctrl-s` | Protocol / Zod (source of truth) |
| `ctrl-r` | Model providers |
| `ctrl-z` | SQLite memory & migrations |
| `ctrl-x` | Agent loop & tools |
| `ctrl-m` | MCP client |
| `ctrl-k` | Knowledge / embeddings |
| `ctrl-c` | Channel adapters |
| `ctrl-i` | Typed agent client |
| `ctrl-t` | Contract tests |
| `ctrl-slash` | Skills |

## Rules

1. Export a clear public API; keep internal modules unexported when possible
2. Schema or event changes → update `ctrl-s` first, then consumers + `ctrl-t`
3. Only `ctrl-z` / gateway process owns SQLite
4. Test the package with `bun test` in-package; contracts for HTTP/WS surfaces
5. Build with root scripts (`bun run build:ctrl-a`, etc.) — Bun only
